      "html": "<p>Do you know what output is produced when scalac slowly does it’s deed? Have you ever wondered how to write code that will be favorable for your JVM? Should we sacrifice our fancy Typelevel or FP constructs just to make JIT gods happy? Let’s dive deep into the Scala bytecode.</p>"
